    "execution_plan": "# Summary\nVerify one Clear402 PaymentContext EIP-712 message_sign pact on SETH.\n\n# Operations\n- If owner approval activates this pact, sign one allow-shaped PaymentContext typed-data message.\n- Attempt one deny-shaped PaymentContext typed-data message with mismatched domain/hash for policy denial evidence.\n\n# Risk Controls\n- message_sign only; no transfers or contract calls.\n- Chain restricted to SETH and source address restricted to the current CAW wallet address.\n- EIP-712 domain, primary type, paymentContextHash, and intent are exact-match allowlist conditions.\n- Request-count limit set to two signing requests per rolling 24h window for this verification.",
